    placement: mostly isolated singletons; occasional 4-adjacent pairs allowed (2-6 adjacencies total)
  output:
    same as input but all scatter pixels matching marker_color are erased (set to bg)
    the marker pixel at (1,1) is preserved; bracket unchanged

generation_strategy:
  approach: direct construction (simple transform, no inversion needed)
  steps:
    1. Create 15x15 bg=0 grid
    2. Place the bracket (color 5) at fixed position - col 3 rows 0-3 and row 3 cols 0-3
    3. Pick marker_color from {1,2,3,4,6,7,8,9} (exclude 0 and 5); place at (1,1)
