    5. Scatter 16-32 pixels in the region r>=4 or c>=4, ensuring no cell in bracket bbox
    6. Include 3-5 pixels of marker_color among them (these will be erased in output)
    7. Distribute remaining pixels across other chosen colors (each >=1 instance)
    8. Place pixels mostly isolated; allow a few 4-adjacent pairs but avoid large clusters
    9. Output = copy input, erase all marker_color pixels outside (1,1), restore (1,1)
